<title>UK: BZW warrants on Reed Elsevier.</title>
<headline>BZW warrants on Reed Elsevier.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barclays de Zoete Wedd Warrants Ltd has issued 15 million European-style spread warrants, in two equal tranches, on Reed Elsevier, lead manager Barclays de Zoete Wedd Securities Ltd said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one spread.</p>
<p> WARRANTS   CURRENCY ISS PRICE  PAYOUT</p>
<p> TRANCHE A  STG	1.1025 STG (0.769 REED-1 ELSEVIER)+2.50 STG</p>
<p> TRANCHE B  NLG	2.73 NLG   (0.769 REED-1 ELSEVIER)+6.28 NLG</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   16.JAN.98		 PAYDATE	06.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUX			 MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
